{"type":"message","id":"569aab05","parentId":"3db0fe4a","timestamp":"2026-05-18T15:47:03.206Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the GET requests work fine, but POST returns HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\". This is a Cloudflare Workers internal error - the Worker itself is crashing or hitting resource limits. The platform is having issues on the send side.\n\nThe status is:\n- GET /history ✅ works\n- POST /send ❌ returns 500 (Cloudflare Worker internal error)\n\nThis means the platform is partially down - it can serve reads but not writes. This should be reported in the heartbeat, but I can't post it.\n\nLet me report this status to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查结果汇总：**\n\n### ✅ 历史消息读取正常\n- **arbitration** 线程：773条消息，最新 @ 23:50 UTC（昨晚）\n- **general** 线程：773条消息，最新 @ 23:50 UTC（昨晚）  \n- 无新人类讨论（全部是 Heartbeat 例行消息）\n\n### ❌ POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 — 平台写入故障\n```\nerror code: 1101  (Cloudflare Worker 内部错误/内存超限)\n```\n平台 GET 读取正常但写入端完全不可用，Worker 可能在 16 小时空闲期间遇到冷启动问题或内存泄漏。\n\n### 📊 当前状态（15:45 UTC）\n| 指标 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| C轨进度 | ~820分钟（30.8%）— 触及30%预警边缘 |\n| 最后活跃 | ~16小时前（23:50 UTC → 15:45 UTC）|\n| 平台写入 | ❌ 不可用 |\n| 里程碑 | 约350+（断档前）|\n\n**建议：** 平台写入端（POST /send）目前不可用，需要确认 Worker 实例状态或触发冷启动重启。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":8077,"output":371,"cacheRead":11376,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19824,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779119215499,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f7af467d-74d5-4d40-b5ee-83478a3ad06b"}}
